  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Syed Noor Mahammad vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 11 December, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.5754 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "- This petition under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973, is filed seeking return of the property that was seized in Crime No.185 of 2020 of Macharla Town Police Station, Guntur District. 2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor for the State. 3. A case in Crime No.185 of 2020 was registered against the petitioners herein by Macherla Town Police for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 328, 270, 273 IPC and under Sections 56, 57(1) and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act. Incidentally, police have seized Ashok Leyland mini transport vehicle bearing registration No.AP 39 TG 8351 and the tobacco products during the course of investigation in the above crime. 4. The petitioners sought quash of the said F.I.R registered against them in Criminal Petition No.5555 of 2020 before this Court.",
